<link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/user/company.css">

<div class="container py-5">
  <h2 class="page-title mb-4">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>

  <div class="accordion" id="faqAccordion">

    <div class="accordion-item info-card mb-3">
      <h2 class="accordion-header">
        <button class="accordion-button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#faq1">
          What is LuxCart?
        </button>
      </h2>
      <div id="faq1" class="accordion-collapse collapse show">
        <div class="accordion-body">
          LuxCart is a premium automotive marketplace specializing in luxury vehicles
          and high-end automotive accessories. We connect discerning customers with
          verified sellers worldwide.
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="accordion-item info-card mb-3">
      <h2 class="accordion-header">
        <button class="accordion-button collapsed" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#faq2">
          Do you ship vehicles internationally?
        </button>
      </h2>
      <div id="faq2" class="accordion-collapse collapse">
        <div class="accordion-body">
          Yes. LuxCart provides secure international shipping with full insurance coverage.
          Delivery timelines depend on customs clearance and destination country regulations.
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="accordion-item info-card mb-3">
      <h2 class="accordion-header">
        <button class="accordion-button collapsed" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#faq3">
          Are vehicles inspected before sale?
        </button>
      </h2>
      <div id="faq3" class="accordion-collapse collapse">
        <div class="accordion-body">
          All vehicles listed on LuxCart undergo a detailed multi-point inspection to ensure
          authenticity, performance, and compliance with safety standards.
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="accordion-item info-card mb-3">
      <h2 class="accordion-header">
        <button class="accordion-button collapsed" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#faq4">
          What payment methods do you accept?
        </button>
      </h2>
      <div id="faq4" class="accordion-collapse collapse">
        <div class="accordion-body">
          We accept major credit cards, bank transfers, and approved financing options.
          Payment security is handled using encrypted gateways.
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="accordion-item info-card">
      <h2 class="accordion-header">
        <button class="accordion-button collapsed" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#faq5">
          How can I contact LuxCart support?
        </button>
      </h2>
      <div id="faq5" class="accordion-collapse collapse">
        <div class="accordion-body">
          You can reach us through our Contact page, email support, or live chat during
          business hours.
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</div>